# ============================================================================
# SovereignVoice frontend environment (OPTIONAL)
# ============================================================================
# The frontend NEVER holds provider credentials. The Gnani API_KEY_ID and the
# Groq API key live only in backend/.env.
#
# You normally do not need this file at all: in development Vite proxies
# /api and /health to http://127.0.0.1:8000 (see vite.config.ts).
#
# Only set VITE_API_BASE_URL when the backend runs on a different origin and
# you are not using the Vite proxy (for example a static production build).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
